<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AutoDoc — Sistema de gestão para despachantes</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Pedidos, multas, clientes, financeiro e metas do seu escritório em um só painel. Sistema de gestão para despachantes e empresas automotivas.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
    :root {
        --orange: #F26522;
        --orange-hot: #FF7C3C;
        --orange-deep: #D24E10;
        --orange-soft: #FFF6F1;
        --orange-line: #FBDCC9;
        --ink: #1A2331;
        --slate: #68758A;
        --slate-light: #8D99AB;
        --line: #EDF0F4;
        --bg: #FAFBFC;
        --green: #17A55C;
    }

    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0
    }

    html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
        html {
            scroll-behavior: auto
        }

        * {
            animation: none !important;
            transition: none !important
        }
    }

    body {
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16.5px;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.65;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        overflow-x: hidden
    }

    .wrap {
        max-width: 1180px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 28px
    }

    a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none
    }

    img {
        max-width: 100%;
        display: block
    }

    :focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--orange);
        outline-offset: 3px
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 {
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -.028em;
        line-height: 1.15
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.6vw, 3.8rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.08;
        letter-spacing: -.035em
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.5rem)
    }

    h3 {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -.015em
    }

    .eyebrow {
        font-size: .78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: .1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--orange)
    }

    .lede {
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.25vw, 1.13rem);
        font-weight: 300;
        color: var(--slate);
        max-width: 58ch;
        line-height: 1.7
    }

    /* header */
    header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 60;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)
    }

    .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        height: 76px;
        position: relative
    }

    .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px
    }

    .brand img {
        height: 30px;
        width: auto
    }

    .brand span {
        font-size: 1.18rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -.03em
    }

    .brand .o {
        color: var(--orange)
    }

    .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 34px;
        font-size: .92rem;
        font-weight: 400
    }

    .nav-links a.link {
        color: var(--slate);
        transition: color .2s
    }

    .nav-links a.link:hover {
        color: var(--ink)
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 12px 22px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: .92rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -.01em;
        white-space: nowrap;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        transition: background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s, transform .15s
    }

    .btn-primary {
        background: var(--orange);
        color: #fff
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
        background: var(--orange-hot);
        transform: translateY(-1px)
    }

    .btn-outline {
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--ink);
        border-color: var(--line)
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
        border-color: var(--orange);
        color: var(--orange)
    }

    .btn-white {
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--orange-deep)
    }

    .btn-white:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px)
    }

    .btn-ghost-w {
        background: transparent;
        color: #fff;
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .45)
    }

    .btn-ghost-w:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12)
    }

    .menu-btn {
        display: none;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 9px 14px;
        font: inherit;
        font-size: .85rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer
    }

    /* hero */
    .hero {
        position: relative;
        padding: 88px 0 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--orange-soft) 0%, #fff 55%);
        overflow: hidden
    }

    .hero-top {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        max-width: 820px
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--orange-line);
        color: var(--orange-deep);
        font-size: .78rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 99px
    }

    .badge i {
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--green);
        animation: pulse 2.4s infinite
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
        50% {
            opacity: .35
        }
    }

    .hero h1 {
        margin: 22px 0 20px
    }

    .hero h1 em {
        font-style: normal;
        color: var(--orange)
    }

    .hero-cta {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 30px;
        flex-wrap: wrap
    }

    .trust {
        margin-top: 26px;
        display: flex;
        gap: 26px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        font-size: .87rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--slate)
    }

    .trust b {
        color: var(--green);
        margin-right: 7px;
        font-weight: 600
    }

    /* shot */
    .shot-zone {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        margin-top: 60px;
        padding-bottom: 84px
    }

    .shot {
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -22px rgba(26, 35, 49, .2)
    }

    .shot-bar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        padding: 10px 15px;
        background: #F7F9FB;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)
    }

    .dots {
        display: flex;
        gap: 6px
    }

    .dots i {
        width: 9px;
        height: 9px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: block;
        background: #DCE2E9
    }

    .url {
        flex: 1;
        max-width: 320px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: .72rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--slate-light);
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 4px 10px
    }

    .shot img {
        width: 100%
    }

    .shot-note {
        margin-top: 16px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: .76rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: var(--slate-light)
    }

    /* strip */
    .strip {
        background: var(--bg);
        border-block: 1px solid var(--line)
    }

    .strip-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr)
    }

    .strip-cell {
        padding: 38px 28px;
        border-left: 1px solid var(--line)
    }

    .strip-cell:first-child {
        border-left: none
    }

    .strip-cell b {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -.04em;
        line-height: 1;
        color: var(--orange)
    }

    .strip-cell span {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 9px;
        font-size: .87rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: var(--slate)
    }

    section {
        padding: 104px 0
    }

    .sec-head {
        max-width: 58ch;
        margin-bottom: 56px
    }

    .sec-head h2 {
        margin: 12px 0 14px
    }

    .center {
        margin-inline: auto;
        text-align: center
    }

    .center .lede {
        margin-inline: auto
    }

    .cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 18px
    }

    .card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 30px;
        transition: border-color .22s, box-shadow .22s, transform .22s
    }

    .card:hover {
        border-color: var(--orange-line);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 34px -14px rgba(242, 101, 34, .28);
        transform: translateY(-3px)
    }

    .ico {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: var(--orange-soft);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 18px
    }

    .ico svg {
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        stroke: var(--orange);
        fill: none;
        stroke-width: 1.7;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round
    }

    .card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 8px
    }

    .card p {
        color: var(--slate);
        font-size: .92rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.65
    }

    /* fluxo */
    .flow {
        background: var(--bg);
        border-block: 1px solid var(--line)
    }

    .flow-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 48px
    }

    .step {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 28px;
        transition: border-color .22s
    }

    .step:hover {
        border-color: var(--orange-line)
    }

    .step .n {
        width: 28px;
        height: 28px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: var(--orange-soft);
        color: var(--orange);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-size: .82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 16px
    }

    .step h3 {
        margin-bottom: 7px
    }

    .step p {
        color: var(--slate);
        font-size: .88rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.6
    }

    /* split */
    .split {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 68px;
        align-items: center
    }

    .checks {
        list-style: none;
        margin-top: 26px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px
    }

    .checks li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        align-items: flex-start;
        font-size: .95rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--ink)
    }

    .checks svg {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        flex: none;
        margin-top: 3px;
        stroke: var(--green);
        fill: none;
        stroke-width: 2.2;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round
    }

    /* cta */
    .cta {
        background: var(--orange);
        color: #fff
    }

    .cta-inner {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.35fr .65fr;
        gap: 48px;
        align-items: center
    }

    .cta .eyebrow {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82)
    }

    .cta h2 {
        margin: 12px 0 14px;
        font-weight: 600
    }

    .cta p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
        max-width: 52ch;
        font-weight: 300
    }

    .cta-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 11px
    }

    /* footer */
    footer {
        background: #fff;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--slate);
        padding: 64px 0 34px;
        font-size: .9rem
    }

    .foot {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 40px;
        flex-wrap: wrap
    }

    .foot .brand {
        margin-bottom: 14px
    }

    .foot p {
        font-weight: 300;
        max-width: 36ch
    }

    .foot-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 32px;
        flex-wrap: wrap
    }

    .foot-links a {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 400
    }

    .foot-links a:hover {
        color: var(--orange)
    }

    .foot-bottom {
        margin-top: 44px;
        padding-top: 22px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 14px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        font-size: .8rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: var(--slate-light)
    }

    .reveal {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(16px);
        transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease
    }

    .reveal.in {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none
    }

    @media (max-width:980px) {
        .nav-links {
            display: none
        }

        .nav-links.open {
            display: flex;
            position: absolute;
            top: 76px;
            left: -28px;
            right: -28px;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: stretch;
            gap: 16px;
            background: #fff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            padding: 24px 28px
        }

        .menu-btn {
            display: block
        }

        .cards,
        .flow-grid,
        .strip-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr
        }

        .strip-cell:nth-child(3) {
            border-left: none
        }

        .strip-cell:nth-child(n+3) {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line)
        }

        .split,
        .cta-inner {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 44px
        }
    }

    @media (max-width:640px) {

        .cards,
        .flow-grid,
        .strip-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr
        }

        .strip-cell {
            border-left: none;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line)
        }

        .strip-cell:first-child {
            border-top: none
        }

        section {
            padding: 72px 0
        }

        .hero {
            padding-top: 56px
        }

        .shot-zone {
            margin-top: 42px;
            padding-bottom: 58px
        }

        .hero-cta .btn {
            flex: 1
        }
    }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <div class="wrap nav">
            <a href="#" class="brand">
                <img src="data:image/png;base64,"
                    alt="AutoDoc">
                <span>Auto<span class="o">Doc</span></span>
            </a>
            <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <a class="link" href="#recursos">Recursos</a>
                <a class="link" href="#fluxo">Como funciona</a>
                <a class="link" href="#metas">Metas</a>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://autodocoficial.com/gerencial/Login">Acessar sistema</a>
            </nav>
            <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks">Menu</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>

        <section class="hero">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="hero-top">
                    <span class="badge"><i></i>Sistema online para despachantes</span>
                    <h1>Seu escritório inteiro em <em>um painel</em> só.</h1>
                    <p class="lede">Pedidos, multas, clientes, contas a receber e a meta do mês. O AutoDoc mostra tudo o
                        que está acontecendo no escritório assim que você entra — sem planilha, sem caderno, sem
                        procurar.</p>
                    <div class="hero-cta">
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://autodocoficial.com/Login">Entrar no sistema</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://wa.me/555195888759">Falar no WhatsApp</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="trust">
                        <span><b>✓</b>100% na nuvem</span>
                        <span><b>✓</b>Acesso para toda a equipe</span>
                        <span><b>✓</b>Relatórios em PDF</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="shot-zone">
                    <div class="shot">
                        <div class="shot-bar">
                            <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                            <div class="url">autodocoficial.com/gerencial</div>
                        </div>
                        <img src="data:image/png;base64,"
                            alt="Painel inicial do AutoDoc com serviços do dia, contas a receber, saldo do dia e progresso das metas mensal e diária">
                    </div>
                    <p class="shot-note">Painel inicial do AutoDoc · dados ilustrativos</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="strip">
            <div class="wrap strip-grid">
                <div class="strip-cell"><b>24h</b><span>Acesso de qualquer lugar</span></div>
                <div class="strip-cell"><b>100%</b><span>Dados centralizados na nuvem</span></div>
                <div class="strip-cell"><b>Equipe</b><span>Vários usuários no mesmo escritório</span></div>
                <div class="strip-cell"><b>PDF</b><span>Relatórios prontos para imprimir</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section id="recursos">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="sec-head center reveal">
                    <span class="eyebrow">Recursos</span>
                    <h2>Tudo o que o escritório precisa</h2>
                    <p class="lede">Cada área do seu dia com um lugar certo para ficar.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="cards">
                    <div class="card reveal">
                        <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2" />
                                <rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="4" rx="1" />
                                <path d="M9 12h6M9 16h4" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <h3>Pedidos e vendas</h3>
                        <p>Registre cada atendimento, acompanhe o andamento e feche o serviço com o valor certo.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card reveal">
                        <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01" />
                                <path
                                    d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <h3>Multas</h3>
                        <p>Controle infrações, prazos e defesas para não perder nenhuma data importante.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card reveal">
                        <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <h3>Financeiro geral</h3>
                        <p>Contas a receber, saldo do dia e boletim de caixa atualizados a cada lançamento.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card reveal">
                        <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path d="M20 7 12 3 4 7l8 4 8-4Z" />
                                <path d="M4 7v10l8 4 8-4V7" />
                                <path d="M12 11v10" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <h3>Serviços e produtos</h3>
                        <p>Catálogo com preços definidos, prontos para entrar no atendimento sem recalcular.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card reveal">
                        <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                                <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
                                <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <h3>Clientes e fornecedores</h3>
                        <p>Cadastro completo, organizado em grupos, com histórico de tudo que já passou por ali.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card reveal">
                        <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path d="M6 2h9l5 5v13a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z" />
                                <path d="M14 2v6h6M8 14h8M8 18h5" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <h3>Relatórios e lembretes</h3>
                        <p>Gere relatórios do período em PDF e receba lembretes do que precisa ser feito.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="flow" id="fluxo">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="sec-head center reveal">
                    <span class="eyebrow">Como funciona</span>
                    <h2>O caminho de um atendimento</h2>
                    <p class="lede">A mesma sequência do seu balcão — só que registrada.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flow-grid">
                    <div class="step reveal">
                        <div class="n">1</div>
                        <h3>Cliente chega</h3>
                        <p>Cadastre ou busque o cliente em segundos. O histórico dele já aparece junto.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step reveal">
                        <div class="n">2</div>
                        <h3>Abre o pedido</h3>
                        <p>Escolha o serviço do catálogo. O valor entra no financeiro automaticamente.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step reveal">
                        <div class="n">3</div>
                        <h3>Anda o serviço</h3>
                        <p>Atualize o status a cada etapa. Quem atender depois sabe onde parou.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step reveal">
                        <div class="n">4</div>
                        <h3>Fecha e recebe</h3>
                        <p>Baixa o pagamento, gera o PDF e entrega. A meta do dia sobe na hora.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="metas">
            <div class="wrap split">
                <div class="reveal">
                    <span class="eyebrow">Metas</span>
                    <h2>Você vê o mês fechando, dia após dia.</h2>
